de: 'draft' }: anchor 1->0, blob 062bbc87->82ebe33f, result 3 failed / 32 passed of 35 (draft-only, pending-draft and draft-422 pins red; control, refusal and read-failure green), as predicted. R2 put '?? {}' back after layered.effective ?? layered.code: anchor 1->0, blob 062bbc87->c68f7a78, result 1 failed / 34 passed (exactly the refusal pin: 'Unable to find ... Failed to load object/sales_order: (not found)'). Each restore was proven: blob == HEAD 062bbc87 and git diff HEAD empty. CI at report time on 3d2bcf0ab: 42 check runs, 21 success, 3 skipped, 18 in_progress, 0 failed.",
