    "(a) Step 0 used a one-off harness: a vitest file that rendered main's EmbeddedItemEditor (a copy taken with git show from 8f815f4f) and this branch's editor against the live server through a real MetadataClient over node http. Both were untracked files, deleted before any later commit, and git status was verified clean. A direct-HTTP probe (Q1) was also run. The live server's session token and the SQLite file were deleted, the server's process tree was stopped by PID, and the objectstack worktree was removed (node_modules first; it was clean).",
